name:           TreeDiagrams
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis: A minimal library for visualizing trees as SVGs.
description:    
    This is a minimal library for visualizing trees as SVG.
    .
    It provides two kinds of tree visualization 
    .
    1. "normal" tree diagrams
        - `data Tree a = Node a [Tree a]`
        - `data SymbolTree nt t = TLeaf t | NTNode nt [SymbolTree nt t]`
    .
    <<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ren-zeng/TreeDiagrams/bc6a9ce7f7fd738d18518dcdd7aec6f22f9d0e48/test/TestSVGs/TestTreeExample.svg>>
    .
    2. "proof tree" 
        - `data ProofTree r a = Axiom a | ProofTree a r [ProofTree r a]`
    .
    <<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ren-zeng/TreeDiagrams/bc6a9ce7f7fd738d18518dcdd7aec6f22f9d0e48/test/TestSVGs/ProofTreeExample.svg>>
    .



    Please see the README on GitHub at <https://github.com/ren-zeng/TreeDiagrams#readme>
